<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to TripVerse</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #eef3f1; color: #334155; }
      .card { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.12); }
      .brand-bar { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d9488, #0f766e); padding: 22px 30px; color: #ffffff; }
      .brand { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin: 0; }
      .brand small { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 3px; }
      .wave { display: block; width: 100%; height: 26px; }
      .body { padding: 30px 34px 26px; }
      .heading { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #134e4a; margin: 0 0 8px; }
      .lead { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 18px; }
      .points { margin: 0 0 22px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
      .points li { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
      .points li::before { content: "\2708"; margin-right: 8px; color: #0f766e; font-weight: bold; }
      .cta { display: block; margin: 4px 0 20px; padding: 13px 18px; background: #f59e0b; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
      .muted { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #64748b; margin: 0; }
      .footer { padding: 18px 34px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="brand-bar">
        <p class="brand">TripVerse<small>Explore &middot; Escape &middot; Return</small></p>
      </div>
      <svg class="wave" viewBox="0 0 560 26" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M0,26 L560,26 L560,10 C480,22 420,2 330,12 C250,20 190,6 120,12 C60,18 20,10 0,14 Z" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.25"></path>
        <path d="M0,26 L560,26 L560,16 C470,26 400,10 310,18 C230,24 180,12 110,16 C50,20 20,14 0,18 Z" fill="#ffffff"></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="body">
        <h1 class="heading">Welcome aboard, <%= name %>!</h1>
        <p class="lead">Your email has been verified and your TripVerse account is ready to go. Pack your bags &mdash; it&rsquo;s time to explore.</p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li>Browse curated tour packages and destinations</li>
          <li>Book trips and manage your itineraries in one place</li>
          <li>Share reviews and plan your next adventure</li>
        </ul>
        <% if (frontendUrl && frontendUrl.length) { %>
        <a class="cta" href="<%= frontendUrl %>">Start exploring</a>
        <% } %>
        <p class="muted">Need a hand? Our support team is here to help you every step of the way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> TripVerse &middot; Your next adventure is one click away.
      </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>